# Copy this file to ".env" to switch on smart AI sorting.
# Without it the app still works — you just add things by hand.
# Pick ONE engine below.

# ── Option C: Local AI with Ollama (your setup — private, free, offline) ──
# Make sure Ollama is running first: open http://localhost:11434 in a browser
# and it should say "Ollama is running".
AI_ENGINE=ollama
AI_MODEL=qwen3:14b
# AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
#
# FASTER SORTING: the sort step is touched every day, so speed matters. If it
# feels slow, swap to a SMALLER model — it sorts quicker for a tiny accuracy
# trade. Pull one first (e.g. `ollama pull qwen3:8b`), then set:
# AI_MODEL=qwen3:8b
# Even smaller / faster options: qwen3:4b, llama3.2:3b. The app already turns the
# model's "thinking" OFF and asks for a fixed JSON shape, which keeps it quick.
#
# KEEP IT WARM: the very first sort loads the model into memory (a few seconds);
# after that it's instant. The app pre-warms on open and keeps the model loaded
# for 30 minutes between sorts. Change that window (or "-1" to never unload, "0"
# to unload immediately) with:
# AI_KEEP_ALIVE=30m
#
# To use this desktop's AI from ANOTHER computer on your home wi-fi, set this on
# that other device instead (use the desktop's name or IP):
# AI_BASE_URL=http://YOUR-DESKTOP:11434

# ── Option C (alternative): Local AI with LM Studio ──────────────────────
# AI_ENGINE=local
# AI_MODEL=qwen2.5-7b-instruct
# AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1

# ── Option A: Anthropic cloud (needs an API key; a cloud dependency) ──────
# AI_ENGINE=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: change the app's port (default 3000)
# PORT=3000

# ── Dictation (OFF by default) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Voice input is switched off and no microphone button appears anywhere.
# There is no cloud speech option on purpose — if dictation is ever added
# properly it will be in-house, like the AI.
#
# To turn it on later, point STT_URL at your own local Whisper server: the
# audio is then transcribed on this computer and never leaves it. Anything
# speaking the OpenAI transcription shape works — faster-whisper-server,
# whisper.cpp's server, LM Studio:
# STT_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1/audio/transcriptions
# STT_MODEL=Systran/faster-whisper-small
# STT_API_KEY=
